    <briefdescription>
<para>Helpers for implementing custom <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_sched_strategy" kindref="compound">MachineSchedStrategy</ref> classes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These take care of the book-keeping associated with list scheduling heuristics. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_ready_queue" kindref="compound">ReadyQueue</ref> encapsulates vector of &quot;ready&quot; SUnits with basic convenience methods for pushing and removing nodes. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_ready_queue" kindref="compound">ReadyQueue</ref>&apos;s are uniquely identified by an ID. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_unit_1a26a3c0b6567d1e8cf9ac8492e6e5f62f" kindref="member">SUnit::NodeQueueId</ref> is a mask of the ReadyQueues the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_unit" kindref="compound">SUnit</ref> is in.</para>
<para>This is a convenience class that may be used by implementations of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_sched_strategy" kindref="compound">MachineSchedStrategy</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
